  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bSwtJMD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"829\" height=\"211\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>安装Canary前后服务器每刻耗时（mspt）对比图。数据采集于现有世界，渲染距离设为18。</em>&nbsp;</p><h2>适用于Minecraft Forge的Canary模组</h2><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f2abf58992136621156a6de74726a0600f41866a98e576ed7d0152b747e6bc45a%252f68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6c6963656e73652f416264456c417a697a3333332f43616e617279\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2abf58992136621156a6de74726a0600f41866a98e576ed7d0152b747e6bc45a/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6c6963656e73652f416264456c417a697a3333332f43616e617279\" alt=\"GitHub开源协议\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f07d1f57145e4e727ac8bbd23653a6002661a084c7d66dc9df0eb9800dad3c4c9%252f68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6973737565732f416264456c417a697a3333332f43616e617279\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/07d1f57145e4e727ac8bbd23653a6002661a084c7d66dc9df0eb9800dad3c4c9/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f6973737565732f416264456c417a697a3333332f43616e617279\" alt=\"GitHub问题反馈\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f29c3480feec305d7c4b0783b1edecafc0970dcdf42b7c356a5d73288824e3aaa%252f68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f762f7461672f416264456c417a697a3333332f43616e617279\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/29c3480feec305d7c4b0783b1edecafc0970dcdf42b7c356a5d73288824e3aaa/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f762f7461672f416264456c417a697a3333332f43616e617279\" alt=\"GitHub版本发布\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9456437290db6cab45aa4f4b8f8d74f7215e97b050aaca530b9ae52465731533/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f546869732532306973253230706f72742d537570706f72742532307468652532306f726967696e616c212d6461726b6d6167656e7461\" alt=\"此为分支版本\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</h2><p>Canary是一款通用性能优化模组，是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithium</strong></a><strong>模组</strong>针对Minecraft Forge的非官方分支版本。它<strong>同时支持客户端与服务器端</strong>，且可安装在服务器上<strong>而无需客户端同步安装此模组</strong>。</p><p><strong>Canary</strong>继承了原版<strong>Lithium</strong>的优化特性（生物AI、区块加载、游戏物理效果等），同时<strong>新增了多项优化方案</strong>，在不改变游戏机制的前提下显著提升游戏流畅度。</p><h2>配置说明</h2><p>Canary采用独特的配置系统，用户可自主启用或禁用特定功能模块。详细配置指南请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/AbdElAziz333/Canary/wiki/Configuration-File\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基文档</a>。</p><h2>整合包使用许可</h2><p>欢迎将本模组纳入您的整合包中。</p><h2>问题反馈与功能建议</h2><p>请通过页面顶部的问题追踪系统提交漏洞报告、崩溃信息或新功能提议。我们同样欢迎通过Pull Request方式参与模组开发。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">若希望支持开发者，使用专属代码<strong><span style=\"color:#000\">AbdElAziz333</span></strong>可享首月<strong>25%</strong>折扣，即刻与好友畅玩！</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/AbdElAziz333\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ytD8AVA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
